  - m_Id: 1047039845359616
    m_Localized: Coleoptile -->
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1047209861472256
    m_Localized: Auxin normally promotes the formation of lateral roots and inhibits the development of lateral buds.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1047377742684160
    m_Localized: A deficiency of auxin causes leaf and fruit drop. An excess of auxin, on the other hand, slows down growth.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1049302508789760
    m_Localized: 1) Auxin
